  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: (Yumi shivering from the cold she wakes up confused)
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: Ack! my head..
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: To think that I would pass out inside a dungeon of all places...
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b49ed812a317602409a266999ad2b928, type: 2}
    text: I need to escape this dungeon as soon as possible.
